{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nova Jumper is a one-of-a-kind first person platformer game that lets you parkour your way through levels and tackle hordes of enemies with friends or in VR.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NOVA JUMPER'S ADVENTURE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal as Nova Jumper is to to find a sheep that's gone missing.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start in a spaceship where you are notified of your mission. After heading through a portal, you are thrust into a journey through various unique worlds.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CRAZY COMBAT!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies shoot physical bullets at you, forcing you to dodge and weave your way through their attacks</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ONLINE CO-OP</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why play alone when you can have your friends join in on the fun?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite friends to play through Steam</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTER CUSTOMIZATION</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character with the menu found on the home screen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine different colors with various skins to create your own unique character!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VIRTUAL REALITY (OCULUS CV1)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Oculus CV1 has been tested to work with Nova Jumper</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the game by aiming at enemies and shooting with your hand, while moving and jumping with the Rift controllers.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COOL STUFF!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >28 unique stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trampolines, motorcycles, and interplanetary gravity all await you in Nova Jumper!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/i